{"id":"spectrum","title":"turbo_spectrum.x","program":"turbo_spectrum.x","package":"turboTDDFPT","version":"7.5","html":"<section class=\"qe-section qe-sec-intro\" id=\"intro\" data-kind=\"intro\" data-title=\"Introduction\"><h2 class=\"qe-section-title\">Introduction</h2>\n\n<div class=\"qe-indent\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">Input data format: { } = optional, [ ] = it depends.</p>\n<p class=\"qe-flow\">All quantities whose dimensions are not explicitly specified are in<br>RYDBERG ATOMIC UNITS</p>\n<p class=\"qe-flow\">BEWARE: TABS, DOS &lt;CR&gt;&lt;LF&gt; CHARACTERS ARE POTENTIAL SOURCES OF TROUBLE</p>\n<p class=\"qe-flow\">Comment lines in namelists can be introduced by a \"!\", exactly as in\nfortran code. Comments lines in ``cards'' can be introduced by\neither a \"!\" or a \"#\" character in the first position of a line.</p>\n<pre class=\"qe-pre\"><b>Structure of the input data:</b>\n===============================================================================\n\n&amp;LR_INPUT\n  ...\n/</pre></div>\n</section>\n   <section class=\"qe-section qe-sec-namelist\" id=\"LR_INPUT\" data-kind=\"namelist\" data-title=\"&amp;LR_INPUT\" data-name=\"LR_INPUT\"><h2 class=\"qe-section-title\"><span class=\"qe-kind\">Namelist</span> <span class=\"qe-nl\">&amp;LR_INPUT</span></h2><div class=\"qe-layout\">\n      <p><b> This namelist is always needed !\n      </b></p>\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"prefix\" data-var=\"prefix\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#prefix\">prefix</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">CHARACTER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"prefix\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>'pwscf'</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">Sets the prefix for generated and read files. The files\ngenerated by the ground state pw.x run should have this\nsame prefix.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"outdir\" data-var=\"outdir\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#outdir\">outdir</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">CHARACTER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"outdir\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>'./'</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">The directory that contains the run critical files, which\ninclude the files generated by ground state pw.x run.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"verbosity\" data-var=\"verbosity\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#verbosity\">verbosity</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">INTEGER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"verbosity\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>1</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">This integer variable controls the amount of information\nwritten to standard output.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"itermax0\" data-var=\"itermax0\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#itermax0\">itermax0</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">INTEGER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"itermax0\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>500</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">Number of Lanczos coefficients to be read from the file.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"itermax\" data-var=\"itermax\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#itermax\">itermax</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">INTEGER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"itermax\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>500</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">The total number of Lanczos coefficients that will be\nconsidered in the calculation of the polarizability/absorption\ncoefficient. If itermax &gt; itermax0, the Lanczos coefficients\nin between itermax0+1 and itermax will be extrapolated.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"extrapolation\" data-var=\"extrapolation\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#extrapolation\">extrapolation</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">CHARACTER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"extrapolation\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>'no'</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\">\n<p class=\"qe-flow\">Sets the extrapolation scheme.</p>\n<dl class=\"qe-options\"><div class=\"qe-opt\"><dt><code>'osc'</code></dt><dd><p class=\"qe-flow\">biconstant extrapolation</p></dd></div><div class=\"qe-opt\"><dt><code>'constant'</code></dt><dd><p class=\"qe-flow\">constant extrapolation</p></dd></div><div class=\"qe-opt\"><dt><code>'no'</code></dt><dd><p class=\"qe-flow\">no extrapolation.</p></dd></div></dl>\n\n</div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"epsil\" data-var=\"epsil\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#epsil\">epsil</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">REAL</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"epsil\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>0.02</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><pre class=\"qe-pre\">The broadening/damping term. In Rydberg units if magnons=.false.,\n    in meV if magnons = .true.</pre></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"units\" data-var=\"units\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#units\">units</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">INTEGER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"units\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>0</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><pre class=\"qe-pre\">    The unit system used for the output and the start, end and increment\ninput parameters. (only meV used in that case).\n\n0 = Rydbergs, 1 = Electron volts, 2 = Nanometres per electron volts,\n3 = milli Electron volts (only for magnons=.true.)</pre></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"start\" data-var=\"start\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#start\">start</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">REAL</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"start\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>0.0</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><pre class=\"qe-pre\">  The polarizability and the absorption coefficient are computed\nstarting from this value. In units set.</pre></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"end\" data-var=\"end\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#end\">end</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">REAL</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"end\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>2.5</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><pre class=\"qe-pre\">  The polarizability and the absorption coefficient are computed\nup to this value. In units set.</pre></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"increment\" data-var=\"increment\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#increment\">increment</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">REAL</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"increment\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>0.001</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><pre class=\"qe-pre\">  Incremental step used to define the mesh between start and end.\nIn units set.</pre></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"ipol\" data-var=\"ipol\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#ipol\">ipol</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">INTEGER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"ipol\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>1</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><pre class=\"qe-pre\">An integer variable that determines which element of the\ndynamical polarizability will be computed:\n1 -&gt; alpha_xx(omega), 2 -&gt; alpha_yy(omega), and\n3 -&gt; alpha_zz(omega). When set to 4, three Lanczos chains\nare sequentially performed and the full polarizability\ntensor and the absorption coefficient are computed.</pre></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"eels\" data-var=\"eels\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#eels\">eels</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">LOGICAL</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"eels\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>.false.</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">Must be set to .true. for EELS. EELS-specific operations\nwill be performed.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"magnons\" data-var=\"magnons\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#magnons\">magnons</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">LOGICAL</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"magnons\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>.false.</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">Must be set to .true. for magnon-calculation post-processing.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"td\" data-var=\"td\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#td\">td</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">CHARACTER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"td\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>'lanczos'</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">When set to 'lanczos', a calculation of the spectrum is\nperformed using the Lanczos coefficients.\nWhen set to 'davidson' or 'david', a calculation of the\nspectrum is performed using the eigenvalues computed\nusing the Davidson algorithm. See the variable 'eign_file'.</p></div></article>\n\n      <article class=\"qe-var\" id=\"eign_file\" data-var=\"eign_file\"><header class=\"qe-var-head\"><h3 class=\"qe-var-name\"><a class=\"qe-self\" href=\"#eign_file\">eign_file</a></h3> <span class=\"qe-type\" title=\"Fortran type\">CHARACTER</span> <span class=\"qe-var-tools\" data-var=\"eign_file\"></span></header><dl class=\"qe-meta\"><div class=\"qe-meta-row qe-meta-default\"><dt>Default</dt><dd>'pwscf.eigen'</dd></div></dl><div class=\"qe-desc\"><p class=\"qe-flow\">The name of the file produced by the turbo_davidson.x code,\nin which are written the eigenvalues.</p></div></article>\n\n   </div></section>","sections":[{"id":"intro","title":"Introduction","kind":"intro","level":0,"varIds":[]},{"id":"LR_INPUT","title":"&LR_INPUT","kind":"namelist","name":"LR_INPUT","level":0,"varIds":["prefix","outdir","verbosity","itermax0","itermax","extrapolation","epsil","units","start","end","increment","ipol","eels","magnons","td","eign_file"]}],"variables":[{"id":"prefix","names":["prefix"],"display":"prefix","type":"CHARACTER","default":"'pwscf'","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"Sets the prefix for generated and read files."},{"id":"outdir","names":["outdir"],"display":"outdir","type":"CHARACTER","default":"'./'","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"The directory that contains the run critical files, which include the files generated by ground state pw.x run."},{"id":"verbosity","names":["verbosity"],"display":"verbosity","type":"INTEGER","default":"1","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"This integer variable controls the amount of information written to standard output."},{"id":"itermax0","names":["itermax0"],"display":"itermax0","type":"INTEGER","default":"500","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"Number of Lanczos coefficients to be read from the file."},{"id":"itermax","names":["itermax"],"display":"itermax","type":"INTEGER","default":"500","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"The total number of Lanczos coefficients that will be considered in the calculation of the polarizability/absorption coefficient."},{"id":"extrapolation","names":["extrapolation"],"display":"extrapolation","type":"CHARACTER","default":"'no'","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":["'osc'","'constant'","'no'"],"summary":"Sets the extrapolation scheme. 'osc' biconstant extrapolation 'constant' constant extrapolation 'no' no extrapolation."},{"id":"epsil","names":["epsil"],"display":"epsil","type":"REAL","default":"0.02","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"The broadening/damping term."},{"id":"units","names":["units"],"display":"units","type":"INTEGER","default":"0","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"The unit system used for the output and the start, end and increment input parameters."},{"id":"start","names":["start"],"display":"start","type":"REAL","default":"0.0","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"The polarizability and the absorption coefficient are computed starting from this value."},{"id":"end","names":["end"],"display":"end","type":"REAL","default":"2.5","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"The polarizability and the absorption coefficient are computed up to this value."},{"id":"increment","names":["increment"],"display":"increment","type":"REAL","default":"0.001","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"Incremental step used to define the mesh between start and end."},{"id":"ipol","names":["ipol"],"display":"ipol","type":"INTEGER","default":"1","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"An integer variable that determines which element of the dynamical polarizability will be computed: 1 -> alpha_xx(omega), 2 -> alpha_yy(omega), and 3 -> alpha_zz(omega)."},{"id":"eels","names":["eels"],"display":"eels","type":"LOGICAL","default":".false.","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"Must be set to .true. for EELS."},{"id":"magnons","names":["magnons"],"display":"magnons","type":"LOGICAL","default":".false.","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"Must be set to .true. for magnon-calculation post-processing."},{"id":"td","names":["td"],"display":"td","type":"CHARACTER","default":"'lanczos'","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"When set to 'lanczos', a calculation of the spectrum is performed using the Lanczos coefficients."},{"id":"eign_file","names":["eign_file"],"display":"eign_file","type":"CHARACTER","default":"'pwscf.eigen'","sectionId":"LR_INPUT","sectionTitle":"&LR_INPUT","options":[],"summary":"The name of the file produced by the turbo_davidson.x code, in which are written the eigenvalues."}],"aliases":{"id3":"prefix","prefix":"prefix","id4":"outdir","outdir":"outdir","id5":"verbosity","verbosity":"verbosity","id6":"itermax0","itermax0":"itermax0","id7":"itermax","itermax":"itermax","id8":"extrapolation","extrapolation":"extrapolation","id9":"epsil","epsil":"epsil","id10":"units","units":"units","id11":"start","start":"start","id12":"end","end":"end","id13":"increment","increment":"increment","id14":"ipol","ipol":"ipol","id15":"eels","eels":"eels","id16":"magnons","magnons":"magnons","id17":"td","td":"td","id18":"eign_file","eign_file":"eign_file","id2":"LR_INPUT","LR_INPUT":"LR_INPUT","id1":"intro"}}